  "decisions": [
    "Use only client Part 1, where ForeverDB places all six bosses and arrival. Part 2 is a canopy surface that obscures the playable layout; it is not presented as a second dungeon floor.",
    "Chest GUIDs have object ID zero; spawn_group_spawn and spawn_group_entry resolve the two object alternatives. A direct object-template join alone misses them.",
    "Blueleaf Tubers use object 20920: the inspected gopher script seeks these hidden objects, moves to them, and makes them interactable. The 19 older Tuber Node rows (20919) are not substituted for those pickup positions.",
    "Quest objects default off only for this map to avoid crowding the boss/chest view. The same data remain searchable when that layer is enabled.",
    "Excluded external Ratchet/Feralas/Thousand Needles quest-givers, non-Rogue class quest objectives, Horde-only objectives, ordinary trash, herbs, and 19 older trigger-node rows."
